.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt STRALLOC_CATDOUBLE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm stralloc_catdouble
.Nd append a formatted double precision float to a stralloc
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In stralloc.h
.Ft int
.Fn stralloc_catdouble "stralloc *sa" "double d" "int prec"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn stralloc_catdouble
function formats the floating-point value
.Fa d
with precision
.Fa prec
and appends the resulting string representation to the dynamic string
.Fa sa .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns non-zero on success, or 0 on memory allocation failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr stralloc_catlong 3